  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> The number of local maximum/maxima of the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is"
