  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math> <mrow>  <msup>   <mi>f</mi>   <mo>&#x2032;</mo>  </msup>  <mfenced>   <mi>x</mi>  </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup>   <mrow>    <mi>sin</mi></mrow>   <mn>2</mn>  </msup>  <mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x2212;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0013_754a24fec7fb.png\" style=\"width:2.08681in;height:0.96667in\" /><br />Hence, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> shows no local maximum."
